The ReSTIR story's count over frames
====================================

What the story draws on the canvas (lab/src/math/) for chapter 5's beat `c5-temporal-math`, stage by stage as
its stage (`stepOf "history" 4`, the clips below) goes from 0 to 4: a pixel's M over frames of temporal reuse alone, as the lab's temporal pass counts
it (examples.rs `history`, cpu.rs `temporal_m`; the dock's `restirCandidates` and `restirTemporalClamp`): M
climbing frame by frame, without limit; each past frame's share of the reservoir, every one as large as this
frame's; then the clamp, M levelling off and the oldest frames fading.

$[Import* std]
$[Import* render_lab_runtime]
$[Import* render_lab_math]
$[Import* paper_restir_values]
$[Import* paper_restir_natives]
$[Import* paper_restir_common]

The layout

The frames the scene runs over, and the size of its formulas.
$[# _frames 90]
$[# _size 0.44]
Where the formulas go, and the strip of shares.
$[# _rightX 3.75]
$[# _stripBox [% {box {v2 -6.2 -2.45} {v2 6.2 -2.05}}]]

Fn([List(Vec2), Float], List(Vec2)). A curve's points up to `f` along it (1 its first point), the last one
interpolated.
$[# {_upTo points f}
    [# n {length points}]
    [# whole {clamp {floor f} 1 n}]
    [# head {map {range 0 whole} {^ {i} {nth points i}}}]
    {!if {>= whole n}
        head
        {append head {' {lerp2 {nth points {- whole 1}} {nth points whole} {- f {float whole}}}}}}]

Fn([List(Float), List(Float), Float], List(Box)). The strip's segments on their way from one list of shares to the
other.
$[# {_morph a b k}
    [# sa {map {strip "a" a _stripBox {' textColor} 0.01} boxOf}]
    [# sb {map {strip "b" b _stripBox {' textColor} 0.01} boxOf}]
    {map
        {zip sa sb}
        {^ {e} {box
            {lerp2 {.lo {.first e}} {.lo {.second e}} k}
            {lerp2 {.hi {.first e}} {.hi {.second e}} k}}}}]
Fn([String, List(Box), Color, Float], List(Mob)). The strip's segments in `color` and a darker shade by turns, at
opacity `alpha`.
$[# {_segments id boxes color alpha} {flatten {map
    {zip {range 0 {length boxes}} boxes}
    {^ {e} {filled
        {++ id {++ "." {str {.first e}}}}
        {.second e}
        {!if {= {% {.first e} 2} 0} color [% {rgb "#c4569a"}]}
        {* 0.9 alpha}}}}}]

The scene

Fn([], Score). Temporal reuse's count as a score of 4 steps: M over the frames without a limit, the frames' shares
of what P keeps, and the count held at its limit.
$[# {_score}
    [# m {float {restirCandidates}}]
    [# c {float {restirTemporalClamp}}]
    [# free {exampleHistory m 0.0 _frames}]
    [# held {exampleHistory m c _frames}]
    [# top {* m {float _frames}}]
    [# ax {axesIn
        {box {v2 -6.0 -0.5} {v2 0.6 3.0}}
        {axisRange 0.0 {float _frames} 15.0}
        {axisRange 0.0 {* 500.0 {float {ceil {/ top 500.0}}}} 500.0}}]
    [# {_curve ms} {map {range 0 {length ms}} {^ {i} {onAxes ax {float {+ i 1}} {nth ms i}}}}]
    [# freePts {_curve {.m free}}]
    [# heldPts {_curve {.m held}}]
    [# {_along s} {!if {< s 1.0}
        {lerp 1.0 20.0 {smooth {phase s 0.2 1.0}}}
        {lerp 20.0 {float _frames} {smooth {phase s 1.0 1.8}}}}]
    [# {_freeCurve s}
        [# shown {_upTo freePts {_along s}}]
        {append
            {pathThrough "free" shown pColor 3.0}
            {dotAt "freeTip" {nth shown {- {length shown} 1}} 0.08 pColor}}]
    [# axes {flatten {'
        {axesFigure "axes" ax textDimColor 0.34 true true}
        {moveTo
            {caption "axisFrame" {textKey "historymath-frame"} 0.32 textDimColor}
            {add2 {onAxes ax {/ {float _frames} 2.0} 0.0} {v2 0.0 -0.75}}}
        {moveTo
            {tex "axisM" "M" _size textDimColor}
            {add2 {onAxes ax 0.0 {.hi {.y ax}}} {v2 -0.15 0.45}}}}}]
    [# ruleAt {v2 _rightX 2.4}]
    [# rule1 {moveTo
        {texParts "rule" f"{\lit{1}{M_t} = \lit{2}{M} + \lit{3}{M_{t-1}}}" 0.46 textColor
            {' "Mt" "M" "prev"}
            {' accentColor textColor pColor}}
        ruleAt}]
    [# rule2 {moveTo
        {texParts "rule" f"{\lit{1}{M_t} = \lit{2}{M} + \min(\lit{3}{M_{t-1}},\ ${str {round c}}\,M)}" 0.46 textColor
            {' "Mt" "M" "prev"}
            {' accentColor textColor pColor}}
        ruleAt}]
    [# {_readout s}
        [# t {clamp {round {_along s}} 1 _frames}]
        {moveTo
            {tex "now" f"{M_{${str t}} = ${str {round {nth {.m free} {- t 1}}}}}" _size accentColor}
            {v2 _rightX 1.3}}]
    [# freeNote {moveTo
        {caption "freeNote" {textKey "historymath-unlimited"} 0.32 pColor}
        {add2 {nth freePts {- _frames 1}} {v2 0.0 0.4}}}]
    [# limit {* m {+ c 1.0}}]
    [# limitLine {append
        {dashedLine "limit"
            {onAxes ax 0.0 limit}
            {onAxes ax {float _frames} limit}
            estimateColor
            2.0}
        {moveTo
            {tex "limitV" f"{${str {round {+ c 1.0}}}\,M = ${str {round limit}}}" 0.42
                estimateColor}
            {add2 {onAxes ax {float _frames} limit} {v2 1.3 0.0}}}}]
    [# heldNote {moveTo
        {caption "heldNote" {textKey "historymath-clamped"} 0.32 estimateColor}
        {add2 {onAxes ax 50.0 limit} {v2 0.0 -0.35}}}]
    [# sharesNote {moveTo
        {caption "sharesNote" {textKey "historymath-shares"} 0.32 textDimColor}
        {v2 0.0 -1.75}}]
    [# newest {.hi _stripBox}]
    [# {_k s} {smooth {phase s 3.4 3.9}}]
    [# {_boxes s} {_morph {.shares free} {.shares held} {_k s}}]
    [# {_strip s}
        [# boxes {_boxes s}]
        [# k {_k s}]
        {append
            {_segments "sharesFree" boxes pColor {- 1.0 k}}
            {_segments "sharesHeld" boxes estimateColor k}}]
    [# {_newest s}
        [# k {_k s}]
        [# a {boxOf {nth {strip "a" {.shares free} _stripBox {' textColor} 0.01} {- _frames 1}}}]
        [# b {boxOf {nth {strip "b" {.shares held} _stripBox {' textColor} 0.01} {- _frames 1}}}]
        {outlined "sharesNewest"
            {padded {box {lerp2 {.lo a} {.lo b} k} {lerp2 {.hi a} {.hi b} k}} 0.05}
            accentColor
            3.0}]
    [# {_thisNote s}
        [# share {lerp
            {nth {.shares free} {- _frames 1}}
            {nth {.shares held} {- _frames 1}}
            {_k s}}]
        {append
            {moveTo
                {caption "thisNote" {textKey "historymath-this"} 0.32 accentColor}
                {v2 {- {.x newest} 2.1} -2.9}}
            {moveTo
                {tex "thisV" {numberLatex share 3} 0.42 accentColor}
                {v2 {- {.x newest} 0.6} -2.9}}}]
    [# {_still fig} {^ {s} fig}]
    {score "history" 4
        {'
            {part "axes" {_still axes} {'}}
            {part "rule" {_still rule1} {' {becomeOver 3.0 0.4 {_still rule2}}}}
            {part "free" _freeCurve {'}}
            {part "now" _readout {' {exitOver 2.0 0.3 fadeOut}}}
            {part "freeNote" {_still freeNote} {' {enterOver 1.6 0.3 fadeIn}}}
            {part "shares" _strip {' {enterOver 2.0 0.4 {^ {t f} {growFrom t f left}}}}}
            {part "sharesNote" {_still sharesNote} {' {enterOver 2.0 0.3 fadeIn}}}
            {part "sharesNewest" _newest {' {enterOver 2.5 0.3 fadeIn}}}
            {part "thisNote" _thisNote {' {enterOver 2.5 0.3 fadeIn}}}
            {part "held"
                {_still {pathThrough "held" heldPts estimateColor 3.0}}
                {' {enterOver 3.2 0.5 create}}}
            {part "limit" {_still {append limitLine heldNote}} {' {enterOver 3.5 0.3 fadeIn}}}}
        {'}}]

The hook

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). Temporal reuse's count at stage its stage (`stepOf "history" 4`, the clips below).
$[# historyMath {: {^ {t} {playScore {_score}}} Math}]

Clips

The scene's steps as clips (lab/src/clip.rs): its demonstration's Play plays every step in order, a second each;
the story plays each over its sentence's words, and sets the scene back to a step where a beat starts.
$[# historySteps [% {stepsInOrder "history" 4}]]
$[# historyAt0 [% {stepsAt "history" 4 0}]]
$[# historyStep1 [% {stepClip "history" 1 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# historyStep2 [% {stepClip "history" 2 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# historyStep3 [% {stepClip "history" 3 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# historyStep4 [% {stepClip "history" 4 0.0 1.0}]]
